{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋わずー＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんbicycle衣装初公開どーんきらきら♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊今日のセトリ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいーゆーことで、名古屋わず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の名古屋CBCイベント選抜、普段はそう見れないでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な組み合わせね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、屋外だったのよ。暑かったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開リハから見てた方、大丈夫でしたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猛暑日ってやつね。ひめたんも今日は汗が永島聖羅だったてへぺろ(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「滝汗いらりん」？「滝あせいらりん」？とも言うみたいよ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーこんなにぽかぽかした日にライブするのは初めてですよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の熱気とあっつい気温とで、もう最後はハイになって踊ってたのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに夏。野外ライブがいいお天気で本当によかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曇ってどんよりするよりか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラっとさくっと晴れてる今日みたいな日に踊るの気持ちいいね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て感じでひめたんは元気なんだけれども、みなさんは大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対みなさんのが体感温度高いはずよー(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はゆっくり休んでぬ。冷えピタ貼って寝るのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんらが頑張れたのは、みなさんのコールのおかげーよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の長崎も野外なので、えいえいおー＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くよーって方は熱中症対策ばっちりしてきてください約束っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指きりげんまん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘ついたら針1000本..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやひめたんがそんなことするわけ(^^)きらん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新幹線ー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんジージャン似合うイメージあったけど、よく着てるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じーじゃんいっぱい持ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさすがに暑くなってきたから着れないねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ秋に会おうじーじゃん(^^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは男性の仕草で、キュンとするところある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕まくりとかしてたらもうそれだけで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと男の子の仕草に限ったことじゃないけど、頭ぽんぽんーてされるの好きよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからスポーツしてる人はみんなかっくいーと思ふ///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性の髪型で、ツーブロックとアシメだったらどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツーブロックとアシメ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろな。ちょっと存じないのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yahoo!で調べてみよーっとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめた〜んの好きな男性の髪型、髪色は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは色白と色黒の男の子どっちがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは上の質問にもつながってくるけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その人に似合ってればどんな髪も肌も素敵だと思ふ(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりひとり似合うのは違うと思うし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから一概にこれ！とは言いませぬー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクだけの服って持ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってるよー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、まっぴんくの服て、他の服との相性が難しいんよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱじゃまとか、めちゃぴんく(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣もレースのフリル？あれはオリジナル？それともひめたん付けたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーれはもともとそんなデザインだったよ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんそーんな器用じゃないないー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの浴衣涼しそう。でも着ている本人は涼しくないんでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーどうだろね。あの会場の中は涼しくていい感じだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お外に出向いたらきっついかもしれないー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手元にお名前ぺん・コピー用紙・パソコンがない故に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぺこめ返しができないの(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが帰ってくるの待っちょってちー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}